  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **banter - inviting the Shady Horns**: rare: 3 archived performances [5]\n- **banter - inviting Leo**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Come Back Jack**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Cissy Strut**: back after 205 archived shows (3670 days); rare: 6 archived performances [5]\n- **Jesus Children Of America**: back after 28 archived shows (378 days) [5]\n- **If You Want Me To Stay**: back after 28 archived shows (378 days) [5]\n- **banter - inviting George / Shady Horns**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Pungee**: back after 23 archived shows (371 days); rare: 5 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2013-03-15.mk5.flac24** (recommended): audience recording; 21 songs; 151 min [1]\n- **soulive2013-03-15.mk5.flac16**: audience recording; 21 songs; 151 min [2]\n- **soulive2013-03-15.mk21-mk8ms.flac24**: audience recording; 21 songs; 151 min [3]\n- **soulive2013-03-15.mk21-mk8ms.flac16**: audience recording; 21 songs; 151 min [4]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Part of Bowlive IV, night 7 at Brooklyn Bowl [1]\n- Shady Horns joined: Ryan Zoidis, James Casey and Eric Bloom, each also playing percussion [1]\n- Other guests: Leo Nocentelli, George Porter Jr., Adam Deitch, Maurice Brown and Natalie Cressman [1]\n- Part of Bowlive IV, night 7; Leroy Justice opened the evening [2]\n- Guests included Shady Horns, Leo Nocentelli on guitar and vocals, and George Porter Jr. on bass and vocals [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2013-03-15.mk5.flac24**: taped by Eric McRoberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: Audience/On Stage [1]\n- **soulive2013-03-15.mk5.flac16**: taped by Eric McRoberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: Audience/On Stage [2]. Also: The taper also made a separate on-stage mk21/mk8 M-S recording of this show, available in 16 bit [2]\n- **soulive2013-03-15.mk21-mk8ms.flac24**: taped by Eric McRoberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: Audience/On Stage [3]\n- **soulive2013-03-15.mk21-mk8ms.flac16**: taped by Eric McRoberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: Audience/On Stage [4]",
